Package: MiraMR
Title: Mira Mendelian Randomization Toolkit for Academic Research
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Mira", "Developer", , "mtmmu88@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive Mendelian Randomization analysis toolkit designed
    for academic research and educational purposes. Provides tools for univariate
    and multivariate MR analysis, SMR, omics data integration (inflammatory factors,
    immune cells, metabolomics, gut microbiome), and various preprocessing utilities.
    For academic use only - not for unauthorized commercial purposes.
